will be provided on-site.\nL325@P14: Speaker Preparation:\nL326@P14: •\t Software: Each lecture hall (Rooms 4 and 5, see map of the Convention center) is equipped with Office and Acrobat\nL327@P14: reader.\nL328@P14: •\t File types: We accept .ppt, .pptx or .pdf formats.\nL329@P14: •\t Loading your presentation: Please go to the appropriate lecture hall (Room 4 or Room 5) to upload your presenta\u0002tion BEFORE the start of your session. A Whisperer will be there to assist you as needed.\nL330@P14: Poster sessions:\n"
